  "operative_text": "Section 1 (new Section 23-31-930): (A) Notwithstanding another provision of law: (1) no public funds of this State, or any political subdivision of this State, shall be allocated for the implementation, regulation, or enforcement of any executive order, or directive issued by the President of the United States or an act of the United States Congress that becomes effective after January 1, 2021, that regulates the ownership, use, or possession of firearms, ammunition, or firearm accessories; and (2) no personnel or property of this State, or any political subdivision of this State, shall be allocated to the implementation, regulation, or enforcement of any executive order, or directive issued by the President of the United States after January 1, 2021, that regulates the ownership, use, or possession of firearms, ammunitions, or firearm accessories."
